  skillName: 
  description: "Atto x\xF9 l\xF4ng th\u1EADt nhi\u1EC1u v\xE0 cu\u1ED9n tr\xF2n b\u1EA3n
    th\xE2n th\xE0nh 1 qu\u1EA3 b\xF3ng l\u1EDBn di chuy\u1EC3n nhanh trong 4s. Khi
    trong tr\u1EA1ng th\xE1i L\u0103n tr\xF2n, Atto \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c mi\u1EC5n
    nhi\u1EC5m to\xE0n b\u1ED9 s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng t\u1EEB b\xEAn ngo\xE0i v\xE0
    t\u1EEB qu\xE1i b\xEAn trong. Qu\u1EA3 b\xF3ng n\xE0y c\xF3 th\u1EC3 t\u1EA1m
    th\u1EDDi nu\u1ED1t ch\u1EEDng nhi\u1EC1u k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch v\xE0o b\xEAn
    trong khi va ch\u1EA1m, g\xE2y 50 DMG/s cho m\u1ED7i k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch b\u1ECB
    nu\u1ED1t v\xE0o trong, v\xE0 s\u1EBD nh\u1EA3 ra khi timeout. T\u1ED1n 70 Mana.
    Cooldown trong 10s. "
